      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why can't we use SQL\nalone?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "2TkP7vBhomO4mUuhYqUvw",
      "originalText": "Why can't we use SQL alone?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ZZoPr1H6velUiuVhlZgTP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 23.860069274902344,
      "y": 193,
      "width": 228.2798614501953,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 902688616,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 285206808,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788622065148,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Limited expressive\npower\nSome computations\n(loops, complex\ncontrol flow) cannot be\nwritten in SQL",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "uvFp7cfe6kml971U7-R6d",
      "originalText": "1. Limited expressive power\nSome computations (loops, complex\ncontrol flow) cannot be written in SQL",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "O1zQJXMwZ2olIX2BC3ZVA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 324.6800842285156,
      "y": 193,
      "width": 246.63983154296875,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 808174184,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1847645288,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788622065148,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Nondeclarative actions\nPrinting reports, GUIs,\nsending\nresults to a web page —\nSQL\ncannot do these",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "GsyGQX3HTRXHZ5e4fONll",
      "originalText": "2. Nondeclarative actions\nPrinting reports, GUIs, sending\nresults to a web page — SQL\ncannot do these",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
